]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1790f590b75280b12c7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25437-1-7-2","ko":"요즘 계속 야근을 했더니 오늘은 좀 피곤하네요.","zh":"最近一直加班，所以今天有点累啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"야근을","meaning":"加班","explanation":"야근：加班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야근","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90303","senseId":"1","lemma":"야근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야근을","audio":"/audio/0b51441a9a56ccb1685f.mp3"}},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했더니","audio":"/audio/bda5287494be17f016ed.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings"